{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524770/extras/add_to_wishlist.gif?t=1739520393\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524770/extras/horizontal_line.png?t=1739520393\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ski Jumping Simulator throws you into the thrill of soaring through the skies! Grip your skis, take a deep breath, and launch down the ramp\u2014feel the wind rush past as you fight for the perfect landing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524770/extras/f44ef0ea7c54c9025ad9050539380508.gif?t=1739520393\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Ski Jumping Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ski Jumping Simulator puts you in the boots of a fearless ski jumper, racing down icy ramps and launching into the sky. Feel the adrenaline as you soar at breakneck speeds, battling gravity to nail the perfect landing. Every jump is a test of precision, skill, and nerves of steel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524770/extras/dd5ffafcb2f3449bd4a44ad35b0dd082.gif?t=1739520393\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete across multiple slopes, challenge yourself to beat the highest scores, and experience the thrill of flight. With different environments, nationalities, and game modes planned, the journey to becoming a ski jumping legend is just beginning!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3524770?t=1739520393","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3524770?t=1739520393","ca